  storyText: "Pacifica\n\nPacifica: the resort district investors abandoned halfway through building it. Unfinished hotels, dead neon, a Combat Zone NCPD won't enter. This is Voodoo Boys territory.\n\nMirage whispers: \"I can feel their netrunners. They're watching.\"\n\n1. Ask some street kids where the Voodoo Boys are.\n2. Walk into the half-built mall.\n3. Cut through the Combat Zone."
